---
import ArticleLayout from '../../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro';
import metadata from './metadata';
---
<ArticleLayout metadata={metadata}>
  <p>Once you start noticing chevrons, they're everywhere. Open this menu, expand that
    section, go to the next page, reveal a mysterious extra bit of interface. One tiny
    arrow is doing an unreasonable number of jobs. I've been trying to ask what each
    one actually promises before dropping it into a design. Sometimes the answer is
    obvious. Sometimes a few words would have saved everyone a click.</p>
</ArticleLayout>
